{"id":"en_ruined-my-face-and-hands-tycoon-begs-me-to-return","title":"Ruined My Face and Hands? Tycoon Begs Me to Return","titleEn":"Ruined My Face and Hands? Tycoon Begs Me to Return","description":"On her twentieth birthday, painter Leah finds herself accused of a crime she did not commit. Her adoptive brother Eli sets her up, claiming she pushed Vivian. The fallout from this betrayal leaves Leah's face and hands ruined, destroying the tools of her art. Yet the story does not end there. A wealthy tycoon later comes to her, pleading for her return. The series follows this reversal of fortune, tracing how Leah navigates the aftermath of Eli's deception and the unexpected appeal from the tycoon. Those interested in the unfolding drama can follow it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_ruined-my-face-and-hands-tycoon-begs-me-to-return/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_ruined-my-face-and-hands-tycoon-begs-me-to-return/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","limited_free","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dij7u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_ruined-my-face-and-hands-tycoon-begs-me-to-return_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dij7u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ruined-my-face-and-hands-tycoon-begs-me-to-return_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dij7u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ruined-my-face-and-hands-tycoon-begs-me-to-return_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (